  {
   "id": "chainstaff-304750@post-2026-03-04",
   "gameId": "chainstaff-304750",
   "displayName": "New \"Vault\" Ability Added!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-04T23:43:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As we continue to polish ChainStaff for the April 8th release date, I've got cool news. After loads of playtesting I realized we needed just a little bit of extra polish.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Behold--the \"Vault Ability\"!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This is a new, automatic move that happens to the player in the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Any time you are next to a ledge, and you press towards it (left/right), you will automatically try to climb it just a little bit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You don't climb all the way up walls.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But you do kick off of them twice, giving you a tiny boost.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You do not do a full ledge grab. That I feel would slow down the pace of the game. But you quickly do a small wall-hop and it lets you over loads of tiny spots you'd fall normally.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Want to try it out? It's in the free demo on Steam right now! Is it better than a ledge-grab?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Let me know what you think.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
